            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibi ni vyo Umwami Uhoraho yanyeretse: ehe rāba, yarikw arazana inzige, ibirīra bigitanguye kumera; kand’ ivyo birīra n’ivyāmeze ah’ umwami ahejeje gutemesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko zimaze kurya ubgatsi bgo mu gihugu, mperako ndavuga, nt’ Ewe Mwami Uhoraho, enda se n’ubahangaze ndakwinginze! Mbeg’ aba Yakobo bokira bate, n’ukuntu ar’ inkehwa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOL.2.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yow 2:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuk’ Uhoraho aca arīgarura, ati Ntibikibayeho; ni k’Uhoraho yavuze.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
