            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibi ni vyo Umwami Uhoraho yanyeretse: ehe rāba, Umwami Uhoraho yahamagaye umuriro ngw awucishe amateka; ufyeta i bgina hahambaye, kandi wagira utōngōre n’igihugu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze mperako ndavuga, nt’ Ewe Mwami Uhoraho, enda se n’urekereho ndakwinginze! Mbeg’ aba Yakobo bokira bate, n’ukuntu ar’ inkehwa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuk’ Uhoraho aca arīgarura, ati N’ivyo nyene ntibikibayeho; ni k’Umwami Uhoraho yavuze.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
